<view class="page">
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在准备订单…</view>
  <view class="empty" wx:elif="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>

  <block wx:elif="{{item}}">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="title">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="muted" style="margin-top: 8rpx;">租期 {{startAt}} 至 {{endAt}}，共 {{days}} 天</view>
      <view class="row" style="margin-top: 16rpx;">
        <text class="muted">租金</text>
        <text>¥{{rentText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="row" style="margin-top: 8rpx;">
        <text class="muted">押金（还车结算后退回）</text>
        <text>¥{{depositText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="row" style="margin-top: 12rpx;">
        <text class="title">合计</text>
        <text class="price">¥{{totalText}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="form-row">
        <view class="form-label">取车人姓名</view>
        <input class="form-input" value="{{name}}" placeholder="请输入真实姓名" bindinput="onName" />
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <view class="form-label">联系电话</view>
        <input class="form-input" value="{{phone}}" type="number" placeholder="用于门店联系与还车通知" bindinput="onPhone" />
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <view class="form-label">备注</view>
        <input class="form-input" value="{{remark}}" placeholder="取车时间、证件等特殊说明（选填）" bindinput="onRemark" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="muted" style="line-height: 1.7;">
        下单后请在 30 分钟内完成支付，超时自动关闭。押金在还回验车完成后按实际车况结算退回。
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="footer-bar">
      <button class="button-primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{submitting}}">
        {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交并支付 ¥' + totalText}}
      </button>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>